menu "Mosaico diagnostics"
    config DIAG_GAMEPAD_ENABLE
        bool "Enable rev-0.1 left H2 GPIO gamepad (verify wiring first)"
        default n
        help
            Enable nine active-low inputs on GPIO55,53,19,48,18,13,17,12,16.
            Requires the gamepad-board rev-0.1 wiring review. Do not connect
            another module to H2. Default firmware only reads AI and BOOT.
endmenu
